{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_018_23_5_02_018_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:93a619f1dc88627ec8187125ae26471237a1a042a633fe3700dd569b13a74410",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_018_23_5_02_018_23:5_02_018_23:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a65203fdd681141e63d6acb5119fcae2ab2e543bb8ecfda620a4caa7a8b5cf7d",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー酱，辛苦啦。\n现在，稍微方便占用你一点时间吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_018_23_5_02_018_23:5_02_018_23:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:922f4537aa2dd506ef2a60d01fc684384ce88a7037e834ac04ab6f57d9d08939",
      "text": "辛苦了！完全没问题哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_018_23_5_02_018_23:5_02_018_23:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d927b80c36ed19599ed126473a598db022cc8ef7cd2b4267e4d1175a619d75ad",
      "text": "平时一直为我们那么努力拼搏，\n谢谢你啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_018_23_5_02_018_23:5_02_018_23:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1570f4127becc3bcd7398dcdeb52abddcf54e9aa8cac25f566b9392589a54b38",
      "text": "我有样东西想送给那样的制作人酱呢。\n不知你愿意收下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_018_23_5_02_018_23:5_02_018_23:cmd-000033:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7",
      "text": "好的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_018_23_5_02_018_23:5_02_018_23:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4de7d0c3a1d7f6676dc1ffc823efb21f4cd448322e046d4b9a508fb2217f431c",
      "text": "这是情人节巧克力的谢礼哦。\n要是能合你的心意就好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_018_23_5_02_018_23:5_02_018_23:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2093437e2f5fb718d47169056f9911924ffa08091f1845aa539f14863339daf",
      "text": "这是？是美容仪吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_018_23_5_02_018_23:5_02_018_23:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59a347df50d28e5df7b38131d5013de40f33ab64cece736d7f2c0cf57b5f5d10",
      "text": "对呀。我自己也在用同款，\n因为真的很棒，所以特别想送你一个呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_018_23_5_02_018_23:5_02_018_23:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d25c2fdc8d653f30dc9fcb23d10ea82ba7c4107ae98cc86e8b7e88d6ceb5f56",
      "text": "自带香薰功能，可以根据当天的心情\n变换香气哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_018_23_5_02_018_23:5_02_018_23:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0171a6c74e1c1d54f3fb2c508c8281030de5c92b6e9150ca8fa17a6e133456b",
      "text": "我也把我自己推荐的香薰放进去了，\n睡前记得用用看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_018_23_5_02_018_23:5_02_018_23:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d56678f52ee976a38cc6b1a6598a63b3d07cce9d49ddbaa92935da06f24d62b8",
      "text": "一整天的疲劳都会烟消云散的哟♪\n那么，工作要加油哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
